#: corporate/lib/registration.py:35
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Your organization has no Zulip licenses remaining and can no longer accept "
"new users. Please [increase the number of licenses]({billing_page_link}) or "
"[deactivate inactive users]({deactivate_user_help_page_link}) to allow new "
"users to join."
msgstr ""
"귀하의 조직에는 남은 Zulip 라이센스가 없으므로 더 이상 새로운 사용자를 수락할 수 없습니다."
"새 사용자를 추가하려면 [라이선스 수를 늘리거나]({billing_page_link}) " 
"[활동하지 않는 사용자를 비활성화]({deactivate_user_help_page_link})해 주세요. "


#: corporate/lib/registration.py:42
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Your organization has only one Zulip license remaining. You can [increase "
"the number of licenses]({billing_page_link}) or [deactivate inactive users]"
"({deactivate_user_help_page_link}) to allow more than one user to join."
msgstr ""
"조직에 남아 있는 Zulip 라이선스가 1개뿐입니다. " 
"두 명 이상이 새로 참여할 수 있도록 하려면 [라이선스 수를 늘리거나]({billing_page_link}) " 
"[활동하지 않는 사용자를 비활성화]({deactivate_user_help_page_link})해 주세요."

#: corporate/lib/registration.py:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Your organization has only two Zulip licenses remaining. You can [increase "
"the number of licenses]({billing_page_link}) or [deactivate inactive users]"
"({deactivate_user_help_page_link}) to allow more than two users to join."
msgstr "Your 조직 has only two Zulip 라이선스 remaining. You can [increase the number of licenses]({billing_page_link}) or [deactivate inactive users]({deactivate_user_help_page_link}) 으로 allow more than two 사용자 으로 join."

#: corporate/lib/registration.py:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Your organization has only three Zulip licenses remaining. You can [increase "
"the number of licenses]({billing_page_link}) or [deactivate inactive users]"
"({deactivate_user_help_page_link}) to allow more than three users to join."
msgstr "Your 조직 has only three Zulip 라이선스 remaining. You can [increase the number of licenses]({billing_page_link}) or [deactivate inactive users]({deactivate_user_help_page_link}) 으로 allow more than three 사용자 으로 join."

#: corporate/lib/registration.py:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A new user ({email}) was unable to join because your organization does not "
"have enough Zulip licenses. To allow new users to join, make sure that the "
"[number of licenses for the current and next billing period]"
"({billing_page_link}) is greater than the current number of users."
msgstr "A new 사용자 ({email}) was unable 으로 join because 귀하의 조직 does not have enough Zulip 라이선스. To allow new 사용자 으로 join, make sure that the [number of licenses for the current and next billing period]({billing_page_link}) is greater than the current number 의 사용자."

#: corporate/lib/registration.py:119
msgid ""
"Your organization does not have enough Zulip licenses. Invitations were not "
"sent."
msgstr "Your 조직 does not have enough Zulip 라이선스. Invitations were not sent."

#: corporate/lib/registration.py:133
msgid ""
"Your organization does not have enough Zulip licenses to change a guest "
"user's role."
msgstr "Your 조직 does not have enough Zulip 라이선스 으로 change a 게스트 사용자's role."

